# Block Excel files under resorce/ at build time. Operators must mount
# their template via ./resorce:/app/resorce (Docker volume) or set
# EXPORT_TEMPLATE_FILE to a server-side path. This prevents any accidental
# committed template from leaking into the image.
*.xlsx
*.xls
